Learned counsel would further contend that during Inquiry before 5th respondent, the said authority witnessed the high-handed behaviour of 12th respondent with the parents of the petitioner and unless some preventive steps are taken by the respondents, the school environment, in which petitioner is studying, would continue against other pupils, who are SRK, J studying in the school;
that the acts of 12th respondent caused humiliation to the petitioner and such adamant behaviour continued even after an Inquiry, being conducted by 5th respondent.
